load @cluesurf/form/code/structure/field
  find field

# The rational numbers, the fractions, the smallest field containing the integers. Every rational is one integer over
# another, and they are dense (between any two lies a third) yet incomplete (sequences of rationals can close in on a
# gap, like the square root of two, that is not itself rational). Completing them by filling those gaps gives the reals.
# The form carries the underlying field.
form rational
  link field, like field
